sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Lead as Lead Agent
  participant Discuss as discuss Tool
  participant Panel as Role Panel
  participant Router as Model Router
  participant Memory as Meeting Memory
  participant EV as Event Log
  Lead->>Discuss: discuss(topic, roles, models, max_rounds)
  Discuss->>Memory: load prior meeting context
  Discuss->>Panel: create role agenda
  par 同轮并行
    Panel->>Router: call role A
    Panel->>Router: call role B
    Panel->>Router: call role C
  end
  Router-->>Panel: opinions + citations
  Panel->>Discuss: consensus / disagreements / risks
  Discuss->>Memory: persist round summary
  Discuss->>EV: append roundtable.completed
  Discuss-->>Lead: structured candidate advice
  Note over Lead,Discuss: 输出是候选意见，不是验收结论
